<title>BELGIUM: EU TENDERS FOR VEGETABLE OIL AS FOOD AID TO YEMEN.</title>
<headline>EU TENDERS FOR VEGETABLE OIL AS FOOD AID TO YEMEN.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union invited tenders by August 26 for the supply of 1,750 tonnes of rape oil or refined sun oil as food aid to Yemen.</p>
<p>The vegetable oil, which will be distributed by the World Food Programme, should be supplied by October 26.</p>
<p>-Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
